# FLAG (sub-opcode 0): Z N C V E2 E1 H from bits 6..0; when H is set the other flags are kept.
# The destination field holds an immediate indicator; objdump ignores it and the F bit.
:flag^nd1 src1 is (I=0x03 & Cr=0x00 & nd1 & (Br=61 | Br=63 | ((Bb5=0 | (Bb5=1 & Bb4=0) | (Bb5=1 & Bb4=1 & Bb3=0) | Bt=14 | (Bt=15 & Bb0=0)) & Q=0))) ... & src1 ... {
